{"id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax.md","title":"df second order arithmetic syntax","display":"df second order arithmetic syntax","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","aliases":["72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax"],"display":"df second order arithmetic syntax","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.3 and §3.2.3, print219–223,271–272/PDF231–235,283–284; Simpson SOSOA 2nd ed. §I.2, I.5, I.7, https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df second order arithmetic syntax"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.3 and §3.2.3, print219–223,271–272/PDF231–235,283–284; Simpson SOSOA 2nd ed. §I.2, I.5, I.7, <a href=\"https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>数变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_N=\\{x_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(V_N=\\{x_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span> 与集变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_S=\\{X_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(V_S=\\{X_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span> 不相交。基本数函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S,+,\\cdot\">\\(0,S,+,\\cdot\\)</span>，数关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=,&lt;\">\\(=,&lt;\\)</span>。允许另加指定的有限元数数函数/数谓词集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_2(E)\">\\(\\mathcal L_2(E)\\)</span> 为其两类变量语法。集项只有集变量，没有集量化的“全幂集”语义公理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式是有限语法树的最小构造闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 为公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,u\">\\(s,t,u\\)</span> 为数项或下述同类代入项；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z,w\">\\(z,w\\)</span> 为变量。所有逻辑缩写与有界量词的展开在 Assertion 给出；形成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x&lt;t\\,B\">\\(\\forall x&lt;t\\,B\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x&lt;t\\,B\">\\(\\exists x&lt;t\\,B\\)</span> 时要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_N\">\\(x\\in V_N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(\\vec t)\">\\(P(\\vec t)\\)</span> 的递归分支同时包括数等号与小于原子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\vec t,u,z)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}(\\vec t,u,z)\\)</span> 按坐标作用，u与z同类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}(A,u,z,w)\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}(A,u,z,w)\\)</span> 的正式构造见 Assertion；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 在数类代入时为数项，在集类代入时为集变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 由结构递归给出：原子收集项中变量，联结取并，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall z\">\\(\\forall z\\)</span> 删除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>；替换只替自由出现，遇到会捕获的绑定变量先改名为最小可用同类变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}\\)</span> 按数变量后集变量、各自下标递增作全称闭包。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>扩充符号的种类函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_E:E\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\kappa_E:E\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 和元数函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}:E\\to\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}:E\\to\\omega\\)</span> 是指定输入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 标记数函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 标记数谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 与基本符号、变量及语法标签不相交；扩充包含关系同时保留种类和元数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\varnothing\">\\(E=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时两映射为空。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_F:=\\{f\\in E:\\kappa_E(f)=0\\},\\qquad E_R:=\\{P\\in E:\\kappa_E(P)=1\\},\\qquad E=E_F\\mathbin{\\dot\\cup}E_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_F:=\\{f\\in E:\\kappa_E(f)=0\\},\\qquad E_R:=\\{P\\in E:\\kappa_E(P)=1\\},\\qquad E=E_F\\mathbin{\\dot\\cup}E_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists zA&amp;:=\\neg\\forall z\\neg A,&amp;A\\land B&amp;:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\\\\nA\\lor B&amp;:=\\neg A\\to B,&amp;A\\leftrightarrow B&amp;:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\\\\ns\\le t&amp;:=(s&lt;t\\lor s=t),&amp;1&amp;:=S0,\\\\\n\\forall x&lt;t\\,B&amp;:=\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to B),&amp;\n\\exists x&lt;t\\,B&amp;:=\\exists x(x&lt;t\\land B)\\quad(x\\in V_N,\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists zA&amp;:=\\neg\\forall z\\neg A,&amp;A\\land B&amp;:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\\\\nA\\lor B&amp;:=\\neg A\\to B,&amp;A\\leftrightarrow B&amp;:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\\\\ns\\le t&amp;:=(s&lt;t\\lor s=t),&amp;1&amp;:=S0,\\\\\n\\forall x&lt;t\\,B&amp;:=\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to B),&amp;\n\\exists x&lt;t\\,B&amp;:=\\exists x(x&lt;t\\land B)\\quad(x\\in V_N,\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Trm}_2(E)&amp;::=x_i\\mid0\\mid S(t)\\mid t+u\\mid t\\cdot u\\mid f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1})\\quad(f\\in E_F,\\operatorname{ar}(f)=k),\\\\\n\\operatorname{At}_2(E)&amp;::=t=u\\mid t&lt;u\\mid t\\in X_i\\mid P(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1})\\quad(P\\in E_R,\\operatorname{ar}(P)=k),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E)&amp;::=A\\in\\operatorname{At}_2(E)\\mid\\neg A\\mid A\\to B\\mid\\forall x_i A\\mid\\forall X_i A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E):\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E)&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E):\\operatorname{QVar}(A)\\cap V_S=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fml}_1(E)&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E):\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cap V_S=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\nX=Y&amp;:=\\forall x_0\\,(x_0\\in X\\leftrightarrow x_0\\in Y).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Trm}_2(E)&amp;::=x_i\\mid0\\mid S(t)\\mid t+u\\mid t\\cdot u\\mid f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1})\\quad(f\\in E_F,\\operatorname{ar}(f)=k),\\\\\n\\operatorname{At}_2(E)&amp;::=t=u\\mid t&lt;u\\mid t\\in X_i\\mid P(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1})\\quad(P\\in E_R,\\operatorname{ar}(P)=k),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E)&amp;::=A\\in\\operatorname{At}_2(E)\\mid\\neg A\\mid A\\to B\\mid\\forall x_i A\\mid\\forall X_i A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E):\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E)&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E):\\operatorname{QVar}(A)\\cap V_S=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fml}_1(E)&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E):\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cap V_S=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\nX=Y&amp;:=\\forall x_0\\,(x_0\\in X\\leftrightarrow x_0\\in Y).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Delta^0_0&amp;::=A\\mid\\neg A\\ (A\\in\\operatorname{At}_2(\\varnothing))\\mid B\\land C\\mid B\\lor C\\mid\\forall x&lt;t\\,B\\mid\\exists x&lt;t\\,B,\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_1&amp;:=\\{\\exists x_{i_0}\\cdots\\exists x_{i_{k-1}}B:k\\in\\omega\\land B\\in\\Delta^0_0\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^0_1&amp;:=\\{\\forall x_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall x_{i_{k-1}}B:k\\in\\omega\\land B\\in\\Delta^0_0\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^1_1&amp;:=\\{\\forall X_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall X_{i_{k-1}}B:k\\in\\omega\\land B\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Delta^0_0&amp;::=A\\mid\\neg A\\ (A\\in\\operatorname{At}_2(\\varnothing))\\mid B\\land C\\mid B\\lor C\\mid\\forall x&lt;t\\,B\\mid\\exists x&lt;t\\,B,\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_1&amp;:=\\{\\exists x_{i_0}\\cdots\\exists x_{i_{k-1}}B:k\\in\\omega\\land B\\in\\Delta^0_0\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^0_1&amp;:=\\{\\forall x_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall x_{i_{k-1}}B:k\\in\\omega\\land B\\in\\Delta^0_0\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^1_1&amp;:=\\{\\forall X_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall X_{i_{k-1}}B:k\\in\\omega\\land B\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(x)&amp;:=\\{x\\}\\quad(x\\in V_N\\cup V_S),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(0):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(f(\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(t\\in X)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\{X\\},\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(P(\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\neg A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(A\\to B):=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall zA):=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{z\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{QVar}(P(\\vec t))&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{QVar}(t\\in X):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{QVar}(\\neg A):=\\operatorname{QVar}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{QVar}(A\\to B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{QVar}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(B),\\quad\\operatorname{QVar}(\\forall zA):=\\operatorname{QVar}(A)\\cup\\{z\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(x)&amp;:=\\{x\\}\\quad(x\\in V_N\\cup V_S),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(0):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(f(\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(t\\in X)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\{X\\},\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(P(\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\neg A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(A\\to B):=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall zA):=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{z\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{QVar}(P(\\vec t))&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{QVar}(t\\in X):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{QVar}(\\neg A):=\\operatorname{QVar}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{QVar}(A\\to B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{QVar}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(B),\\quad\\operatorname{QVar}(\\forall zA):=\\operatorname{QVar}(A)\\cup\\{z\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V(w):=\\begin{cases}V_N,&amp;w\\in V_N,\\\\V_S,&amp;w\\in V_S,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\operatorname{idx}(x_i):=i,\\quad\\operatorname{idx}(X_i):=i,\\quad\\nu_w(i):=\\begin{cases}x_i,&amp;w\\in V_N,\\\\X_i,&amp;w\\in V_S.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V(w):=\\begin{cases}V_N,&amp;w\\in V_N,\\\\V_S,&amp;w\\in V_S,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\operatorname{idx}(x_i):=i,\\quad\\operatorname{idx}(X_i):=i,\\quad\\nu_w(i):=\\begin{cases}x_i,&amp;w\\in V_N,\\\\X_i,&amp;w\\in V_S.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Z(A,u,z,w):=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u)\\cup\\{z,w\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Z(A,u,z,w):=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u)\\cup\\{z,w\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}(A,u,z,w):=\n\\nu_w\n\\bigl(\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:\\exists v\\in V(w)\\setminus Z(A,u,z,w)\\;(\\operatorname{idx}(v)=i)\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}(A,u,z,w):=\n\\nu_w\n\\bigl(\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:\\exists v\\in V(w)\\setminus Z(A,u,z,w)\\;(\\operatorname{idx}(v)=i)\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}(z,u,z)&amp;:=u,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(w,u,z):=w\\ (w\\ne z),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(0,u,z):=0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}(f(\\vec t),u,z)&amp;:=f(\\operatorname{Sub}(\\vec t,u,z)),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(P(\\vec t),u,z):=P(\\operatorname{Sub}(\\vec t,u,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}(t\\in X,u,z)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Sub}(t,u,z)\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(X,u,z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg A,u,z)&amp;:=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(A,u,z),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(A\\to B,u,z):=\\operatorname{Sub}(A,u,z)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}(B,u,z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall wA,u,z)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\forall wA,&amp;w=z,\\\\\\forall w\\operatorname{Sub}(A,u,z),&amp;w\\ne z\\land w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(u),\\\\\\forall\\operatorname{fresh}(A,u,z,w)\\;\\operatorname{Sub}(\\operatorname{Sub}(A,\\operatorname{fresh}(A,u,z,w),w),u,z),&amp;w\\ne z\\land w\\in\\operatorname{FV}(u).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}(z,u,z)&amp;:=u,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(w,u,z):=w\\ (w\\ne z),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(0,u,z):=0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}(f(\\vec t),u,z)&amp;:=f(\\operatorname{Sub}(\\vec t,u,z)),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(P(\\vec t),u,z):=P(\\operatorname{Sub}(\\vec t,u,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}(t\\in X,u,z)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Sub}(t,u,z)\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(X,u,z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg A,u,z)&amp;:=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(A,u,z),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(A\\to B,u,z):=\\operatorname{Sub}(A,u,z)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}(B,u,z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall wA,u,z)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\forall wA,&amp;w=z,\\\\\\forall w\\operatorname{Sub}(A,u,z),&amp;w\\ne z\\land w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(u),\\\\\\forall\\operatorname{fresh}(A,u,z,w)\\;\\operatorname{Sub}(\\operatorname{Sub}(A,\\operatorname{fresh}(A,u,z,w),w),u,z),&amp;w\\ne z\\land w\\in\\operatorname{FV}(u).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\{x_{i_0},\\ldots,x_{i_{k-1}},X_{j_0},\\ldots,X_{j_{m-1}}\\}\\land i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}\\land j_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;j_{m-1}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{ucl}(A):=\\forall x_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall x_{i_{k-1}}\\forall X_{j_0}\\cdots\\forall X_{j_{m-1}}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\{x_{i_0},\\ldots,x_{i_{k-1}},X_{j_0},\\ldots,X_{j_{m-1}}\\}\\land i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}\\land j_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;j_{m-1}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{ucl}(A):=\\forall x_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall x_{i_{k-1}}\\forall X_{j_0}\\cdots\\forall X_{j_{m-1}}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}[U]:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(A):A\\in U\\}\\quad(U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ucl}[U]:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(A):A\\in U\\}\\quad(U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\langle t_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k},u,z):=\\langle\\operatorname{Sub}(t_i,u,z)\\rangle_{i&lt;k},\\qquad A[u/z]:=\\operatorname{Sub}(A,u,z),\\qquad t[u/z]:=\\operatorname{Sub}(t,u,z).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\langle t_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k},u,z):=\\langle\\operatorname{Sub}(t_i,u,z)\\rangle_{i&lt;k},\\qquad A[u/z]:=\\operatorname{Sub}(A,u,z),\\qquad t[u/z]:=\\operatorname{Sub}(t,u,z).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QF}_1(E):=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_1(E):\\operatorname{QVar}(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{QF}_1(E):=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_1(E):\\operatorname{QVar}(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有界量词的展开和界项自由变量旁条件已放入前两节；遮去本节不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^0_0\">\\(\\Delta^0_0\\)</span> 的含义。QVar递归收集所有被量化的变量。各公式类使用显示的前束正规形代表，允许数与集自由参数。集相等是外延缩写，故无需另加未解释的集相等原子。Ch.IV明确采用两类变量的一阶式演算；这与在元理论中让X遍历全部子集的语义断言有别。</p>\n<p>2026-10-13 修订：正式给出同类新鲜变量的最小下标构造，并将集变量纳入自由变量函数的原子分支。排除集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z(A,u,z,w)\">\\(Z(A,u,z,w)\\)</span> 有限，而每类变量无限，因此最小下标存在且唯一。捕获分支直接使用该变量项，避免把未绑定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 仅写在 cases 条件中。递归重命名进入真子公式；新鲜变量不在任何内部绑定中，故重命名过程不再触发同类捕获。其余公式/项递归严格沿有限树下降。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"V_N=\\{x_i:i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V_S=\\{X_i:i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0,S,+,\\cdot","display":false},{"tex":"=,<","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_2(E)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"s,t,u","display":false},{"tex":"z,w","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x<t\\,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x<t\\,B","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V_N","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"P(\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\vec t,u,z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}(A,u,z,w)","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall z","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ucl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_E:E\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}:E\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"E=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"E_F:=\\{f\\in E:\\kappa_E(f)=0\\},\\qquad E_R:=\\{P\\in E:\\kappa_E(P)=1\\},\\qquad E=E_F\\mathbin{\\dot\\cup}E_R.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists zA&:=\\neg\\forall z\\neg A,&A\\land B&:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\\\\nA\\lor B&:=\\neg A\\to B,&A\\leftrightarrow B&:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\\\\ns\\le t&:=(s<t\\lor s=t),&1&:=S0,\\\\\n\\forall x<t\\,B&:=\\forall x(x<t\\to B),&\n\\exists x<t\\,B&:=\\exists x(x<t\\land B)\\quad(x\\in V_N,\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Trm}_2(E)&::=x_i\\mid0\\mid S(t)\\mid t+u\\mid t\\cdot u\\mid f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1})\\quad(f\\in E_F,\\operatorname{ar}(f)=k),\\\\\n\\operatorname{At}_2(E)&::=t=u\\mid t<u\\mid t\\in X_i\\mid P(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1})\\quad(P\\in E_R,\\operatorname{ar}(P)=k),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E)&::=A\\in\\operatorname{At}_2(E)\\mid\\neg A\\mid A\\to B\\mid\\forall x_i A\\mid\\forall X_i A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)&:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E):\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E)&:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E):\\operatorname{QVar}(A)\\cap V_S=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fml}_1(E)&:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E):\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cap V_S=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\nX=Y&:=\\forall x_0\\,(x_0\\in X\\leftrightarrow x_0\\in Y).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Delta^0_0&::=A\\mid\\neg A\\ (A\\in\\operatorname{At}_2(\\varnothing))\\mid B\\land C\\mid B\\lor C\\mid\\forall x<t\\,B\\mid\\exists x<t\\,B,\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_1&:=\\{\\exists x_{i_0}\\cdots\\exists x_{i_{k-1}}B:k\\in\\omega\\land B\\in\\Delta^0_0\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^0_1&:=\\{\\forall x_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall x_{i_{k-1}}B:k\\in\\omega\\land B\\in\\Delta^0_0\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^1_1&:=\\{\\forall X_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall X_{i_{k-1}}B:k\\in\\omega\\land B\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(x)&:=\\{x\\}\\quad(x\\in V_N\\cup V_S),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(0):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(f(\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(t\\in X)&:=\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\{X\\},\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(P(\\vec t)):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\neg A)&:=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(A\\to B):=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall zA):=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{z\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{QVar}(P(\\vec t))&:=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{QVar}(t\\in X):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{QVar}(\\neg A):=\\operatorname{QVar}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{QVar}(A\\to B)&:=\\operatorname{QVar}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(B),\\quad\\operatorname{QVar}(\\forall zA):=\\operatorname{QVar}(A)\\cup\\{z\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"V(w):=\\begin{cases}V_N,&w\\in V_N,\\\\V_S,&w\\in V_S,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\operatorname{idx}(x_i):=i,\\quad\\operatorname{idx}(X_i):=i,\\quad\\nu_w(i):=\\begin{cases}x_i,&w\\in V_N,\\\\X_i,&w\\in V_S.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"Z(A,u,z,w):=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u)\\cup\\{z,w\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}(A,u,z,w):=\n\\nu_w\n\\bigl(\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:\\exists v\\in V(w)\\setminus Z(A,u,z,w)\\;(\\operatorname{idx}(v)=i)\\}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}(z,u,z)&:=u,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(w,u,z):=w\\ (w\\ne z),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(0,u,z):=0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}(f(\\vec t),u,z)&:=f(\\operatorname{Sub}(\\vec t,u,z)),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(P(\\vec t),u,z):=P(\\operatorname{Sub}(\\vec t,u,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}(t\\in X,u,z)&:=\\operatorname{Sub}(t,u,z)\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(X,u,z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg A,u,z)&:=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(A,u,z),\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(A\\to B,u,z):=\\operatorname{Sub}(A,u,z)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}(B,u,z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall wA,u,z)&:=\\begin{cases}\\forall wA,&w=z,\\\\\\forall w\\operatorname{Sub}(A,u,z),&w\\ne z\\land w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(u),\\\\\\forall\\operatorname{fresh}(A,u,z,w)\\;\\operatorname{Sub}(\\operatorname{Sub}(A,\\operatorname{fresh}(A,u,z,w),w),u,z),&w\\ne z\\land w\\in\\operatorname{FV}(u).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\{x_{i_0},\\ldots,x_{i_{k-1}},X_{j_0},\\ldots,X_{j_{m-1}}\\}\\land i_0<\\cdots<i_{k-1}\\land j_0<\\cdots<j_{m-1}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{ucl}(A):=\\forall x_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall x_{i_{k-1}}\\forall X_{j_0}\\cdots\\forall X_{j_{m-1}}A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ucl}[U]:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(A):A\\in U\\}\\quad(U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\langle t_i\\rangle_{i<k},u,z):=\\langle\\operatorname{Sub}(t_i,u,z)\\rangle_{i<k},\\qquad A[u/z]:=\\operatorname{Sub}(A,u,z),\\qquad t[u/z]:=\\operatorname{Sub}(t,u,z).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QF}_1(E):=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_1(E):\\operatorname{QVar}(A)=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta^0_0","display":false},{"tex":"Z(A,u,z,w)","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false}],"bytes":7503,"backlinks":[{"id":"89c91257b92fc1e7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"语言、全称闭包、公式类与证明关系取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]、[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]。$\\mathsf{RCA}_0$、$\\operatorname{CA}_x$ 见 [[72-df-base-system]]；$X\\in V_S$、$x\\in V_N$。"},{"id":"494fa4cd0ce92258","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E_t,E_f$ 是到 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]] 的一阶片段 $\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)$ 的显式经典翻译；目标里的 $\\land,\\lor,\\exists$ 是该语法已给定的宏。$A,B$ 遍历 $X_N$，$x=v_i$，$t,u$ 遍历算术项。"},{"id":"2d84a32e163edd84","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PA}$、数语法 $\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)$ 与 $\\operatorname{ucl}$ 如 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]、[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]。$\\Sigma_A$ 是 [[72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge]] 的五元数签名；目标使用core的 $\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma_A)$ 与LK序列相继式。"},{"id":"b0618eb9c08a1bca","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"语法、$\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{QVar},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{ucl},\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing)$ 取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]；$\\mathsf{ACA}_0$ 取 [[72-df-aca0]]；配对公式与 $\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)$ 取 [[72-df-coded-well-order]]。所有对象语言联结词按该语法的缩写展开。"},{"id":"18fee81c0ec38350","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]] 的基本 $\\mathcal L_2(\\varnothing)$、$\\Sigma^0_1,\\Pi^0_1$、捕获避免替换和全称闭包，以及 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]] 的 $\\vdash_2$。$B_N$、$\\operatorname{Ind}_x$ 取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]。$x$ 为数变量，$X$ 为集变量，$\\varphi,\\psi$ 为下式限定的公式。"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-273","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax|df second order arithmetic syntax]]"},{"id":"33bb5f7820ca84c2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-271","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df second order arithmetic syntax](72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax.md)"},{"id":"0fa05bc95319d815","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B_N,\\mathsf{PA}$ 取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]。$J_\\varepsilon$ 的源分别为 $\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)$ 与 $\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)$，靶分别为 ε 项与 ε 公式；目标构造子在 $\\alpha$ 商中形成。源语言的缩写先按 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]] 展开。"},{"id":"2e235e3c68d698c2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"数变量 $V_N=\\{x_i:i\\in\\omega\\}$ 取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]；只使用数类变量。$f$ 遍历 $S,+,\\cdot$，元数分别为 $1,2,2$；$R\\in\\{=,<\\}$。各语法构造子与下文 $\\mathsf{free},\\mathsf{bound}$ 标签互不相撞。$\\widehat T,\\widehat F$ 是原始有限树；帽号语法中的 $x_i,0,f,R,\\neg,\\to,Q$ 均表示相应带标签构造子。$s,t,u$ 表示适当类型的树，$A,B$ 表示公式树，$x,y,z\\in V_N$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists,\\varepsilon\\}$。"},{"id":"d363e181512f2d28","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3d1347d7f1a6c20f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]] 的 $E_{\\rm PR},\\mathsf{NT},\\operatorname{Ind}_y$ 和 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]] 的带种类扩充签名、$\\operatorname{Arith}_2,\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{QVar},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{ucl}$；可证性统一取 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]。"},{"id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]] 的语言与 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]] 的有限证明。$B_N$、$\\operatorname{Ind}_x(A)$ 由下式定义；$B_N$ 中固定 $x:=x_0,y:=x_1$，二者互异；$\\operatorname{Ind}_x(A)$ 中的 $x$ 则遍历数变量。全部公理取 $\\operatorname{ucl}$。"},{"id":"da3a454fea13ee06","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"语言、全称闭包、公式类与证明关系取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]、[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]。$\\mathsf{RCA}_0$、$\\operatorname{CA}_x$ 见 [[72-df-base-system]]；$X\\in V_S$、$x\\in V_N$。"},{"id":"1c3ecb3059f70f57","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]] 的 $E_{\\rm PR},\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR},B_N,\\operatorname{Ind}_x$。$\\operatorname{QF}_1(E_{\\rm PR})$ 取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]] 中由 $\\operatorname{QVar}$ 定义的无量词一阶片段。$\\mathsf{PRA}$ 的演算是 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]] 的数变量部分。"},{"id":"b63a805280ad1d8e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]] 的 $\\mathcal L_2(E)$。$T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)$。$\\operatorname{Taut}$ 是在所有 $\\{0,1\\}$ 赋值下取值1的有限命题公式集；用 $\\neg,\\to$ 的通常真值表计算。$\\operatorname{Inst}(\\operatorname{Taut})$ 是以任意 $\\operatorname{Fml}_2(E)$ 替换其命题字母的实例集合。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-289","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax|df second order arithmetic syntax]]"},{"id":"ca4d81197c96530e","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Pi^1_1,\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing),\\operatorname{Sent}_2(\\varnothing)$ 取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]] 的实际句法类。$\\mathsf{HA}_{72},\\vdash_N,E_f,\\Pi^{0,72}_2$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge]] 的独立直觉主义语法及经典翻译。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-256","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]"}],"outgoing":[]}